{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:204","content":{"id":204,"title":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T 细胞的分类："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"辅助线 T 细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"杀伤性 T 细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调节性 T 细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一种还能特化成不同的亚类。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它们指挥其他免疫细胞，并激活最重型的武器。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0e993ec4-952b-4acd-ad7c-39986e3eee51.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0e993ec4-952b-4acd-ad7c-39986e3eee51.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里只介绍辅助性 T 细胞。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"辅助性 T 细胞激活后，第一件事情就是克隆增殖自己，几小时内就有了几千个同样的活化辅助性 T 细胞。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之后分为两组："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"熟悉情况后奔赴战场，受伤 5-7 天后辅助性 T 细胞到达感染地点，指挥战斗，不亲自上阵杀敌，它能增强局部免疫细胞们的战力"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"巨噬细胞体内有凋亡的定时器，辅助性 T 细胞可以一遍遍重置定时器"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"战斗结束后，让细胞们平静下来，最后大部分自我毁灭，小部分会变为记忆 T 细胞，下次遇到相同的敌人，识别速度比先天性免疫系统还要快得多"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"激活【军工厂】的无敌 B 细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:204","type":"doc","id":204}}],"prevPage":{"title":"19 抗原层递","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:203","type":"doc","id":203}},"nextPage":{"title":"21 军工厂和狙击枪","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:205","type":"doc","id":205}},"createTime":1741564571440,"updateTime":1756124019984,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124019984}}